        "Content": "Open viewings\n• Tuesday 1st September @5.45pm 6.10pm\n• Saturday 5th September @10am 10.25am.\n\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 3 Keadeen Avenue, Walkinstown, Dublin 12 to the market a superb four-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned on this mature and highly sought-after residential road. Keadeen Avenue is renowned for its family-friendly surroundings and exceptional convenience, with a wealth of local amenities on the doorstep including Ashleaf Shopping Centre, SuperValu Walkinstown, an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and local shops. The area is also home to a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, together with an abundance of sporting and recreational facilities. Excellent public transport links, along with easy access to the M50, N7 and Dublin City Centre, make this an ideal location for families and commuters alike.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, generous lounge, dining room, fully fitted kitchen and family bathroom on the ground floor, while upstairs hosts four well-proportioned bedrooms and a second bathroom. The property offers a practical and versatile layout, perfectly suited to the needs of modern family living.\nNo. 3 presents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in one of Walkinstown's most established residential locations. Combining generous accommodation with an enviable address close to every conceivable amenity, this property is sure to appeal to growing families and discerning purchasers alike.\nViewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 122 sqm\n• BER D\n• 4 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Presented as a blank canvas\n• Parking to the front\n• Gas heating\n• Sunny large rear garden\n• Side entrance\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• No onwards chain\n• Fantastic Public Transport Links\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for first time buyers, and growing families\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D12 H5Y8"
      },
